<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>HTML5 Multimedia Embedding</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            padding: 0 15px;
        }
        figure {
            margin: 0;
        }
        img, video, iframe {
            max-width: 100%;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        audio {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 500px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <h1>HTML5 Multimedia Elements</h1>

    <!-- 1. EMBEDDING AN IMAGE (<figure> + <img> + <figcaption>) -->
    <h2>1. Image (&lt;img&gt;)</h2>
    <figure>
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1018/700/350" 
             alt="Mountain landscape with a calm lake at sunrise" 
             width="700" 
             height="350">
        <figcaption>Figure 1: Responsive image wrapped in semantic &lt;figure&gt; and &lt;figcaption&gt; tags.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <hr>

    <!-- 2. EMBEDDING AN HTML5 VIDEO (<video>) -->
    <h2>2. HTML5 Video (&lt;video&gt;)</h2>
    <p>Includes playback controls, a preview poster image, and multiple fallback source formats:</p>
    
    <video width="700" height="394" controls preload="metadata" poster="https://picsum.photos/id/1015/700/394">
        <source src="https://www.w3schools.com/html/mov_bbb.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        <source src="https://www.w3schools.com/html/mov_bbb.ogg" type="video/ogg">
        Your browser does not support the HTML5 video tag.
    </video>

    <hr>

    <!-- 3. EMBEDDING AN HTML5 AUDIO FILE (<audio>) -->
    <h2>3. HTML5 Audio (&lt;audio&gt;)</h2>
    <p>Displays the browser's built-in audio player with play, pause, scrub, and volume controls:</p>
    
    <audio controls preload="metadata">
        <source src="https://www.w3schools.com/html/horse.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
        <source src="https://www.w3schools.com/html/horse.ogg" type="audio/ogg">
        Your browser does not support the HTML5 audio tag.
    </audio>

    <hr>

    <!-- 4. EMBEDDING A YOUTUBE VIDEO (<iframe>) -->
    <h2>4. YouTube Video (&lt;iframe&gt;)</h2>
    <p>External video platforms like YouTube are embedded using an <code>&lt;iframe&gt;</code> pointing to the <code>/embed/VIDEO_ID</code> URL:</p>
    
    <iframe width="700" 
            height="394" 
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ" 
            title="YouTube video player" 
            frameborder="0" 
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" 
            allowfullscreen>
    </iframe>

</body>

